    <item>
      <title>Vivaldi CEO怒掀“浏览器AI化”桌子：你们玩儿AI，我玩儿“人味儿”！</title>
      <link>http://192.168.50.247:1313/insights/vivaldi-ceoaiai-20250903074004842-0/</link>
